g: only work you started that will bring you back on its own (a background command or agent, a job, a loop watching CI), with nothing asked of anyone, and nothing else you can do meanwhile: chat_state \"waiting\" with seconds, your estimate of how long until it does, and for, what you wait for. Waiting on a person is need_human.\n> - Otherwise: continue the work.","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1792548775672,"mine":false,"system":true,"reportable":true,"by":{"name":"still.fail"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792548775672,"ago":"刚刚","full":"10/21 10:12:55","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},{"seq":7,"thread":1,"ts":"1792548780.935000","authorKind":"person","author":"alice@example.test","authorName":"Name of alice","text":"选一个颜色 083209 card:按钮用什么颜色 083209|橙色 083209*|灰色 083209","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1792548780935,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Name of alice","picture":"https://example.test/p.png"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792548780935,"ago":"刚刚","full":"10/21 10:13:00","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},{"seq":8,"thread":1,"ts":"1792548780.950000","authorKind":"agent","author":"ember:c-4d25e6d2a3","text":"按钮用什么颜色 083209","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"declared":"block","ending":"need_help","createdAt":1792548780950,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"默认模型","agent":"ember:c-4d25e6d2a3","runtime":"claude","here":true},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792548780950,"ago":"刚刚","full":"10/21 10:13:00","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}},"options":[{"label":"灰色 083209"},{"label":"橙色 083209","recommended":true}],"card":{"assigneeText":"待你决策","type":"options","options":[{"label":"灰色 083209"},{"label":"橙色 083209","recommended":true}]},"decision":{"resolved":true,"answeredBy":"你","text":"你 回复了"}},{"seq":9,"thread":1,"ts":"1792548782.769000","authorKind":"person","author":"alice@example.test","authorName":"Name of alice","text":"部署吗 083209 card:要不要部署 083209|现在部署 083209*|不需要部署 083209!","attachments":[],"quotes":